WEBVTT

00:17:29.499 --> 00:17:32.096
but also, "Why is there peace?"

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:34.052
Not just, "What are we doing wrong?"

00:17:34.076 --> 00:17:36.752
but also, "What have we been doing right?"

00:17:36.776 --> 00:17:38.855
Because we have been doing
something right,

00:17:38.879 --> 00:17:41.274
and it sure would be good
to find out what it is.

00:17:41.298 --> 00:17:42.499
Thank you very much.

00:17:42.523 --> 00:17:49.438
(Applause)

00:17:52.067 --> 00:17:55.000
Chris Anderson: I loved that talk.

00:17:55.024 --> 00:17:57.414
I think a lot of people
here in the room would say

00:17:57.438 --> 00:18:00.523
that that expansion
you were talking about,